<div id="fs-id1167836512155" class="solution"><h5>स्रोतातील उत्तर</h5><p id="fs-id1167829751092"><span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167829751092-1">y = −3x+5</span></p><p><a href="#fs-id1167836599996">प्रश्नाकडे परत</a></p></div></section>
