<div id="fs-id1167829743856" class="problem"><p id="fs-id1167829743859">रेषा <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167829743859-1">y = −(4/5)x+2,</span> बिंदू <span class="math" data-check="src-fs-id1167829743859-2">(8, 9)</span></p></div>
